{
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "dlg.liu-tinglan-mentor",
      "startNodeId": "greet",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "greet",
          "text": "柳听澜坐在讲书堂的案前，笔未停，先抬眼把你打量一遍：「堂中在誊一份要紧文书，不便喧哗。你要问学，还是要问路？」",
          "options": [
            {
              "text": "先生誊的是什么文书？",
              "nextNodeId": "papers",
              "effects": [{ "kind": "discoverKnowledgeNode", "nodeId": "event.ferry-passage-registry" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "晚辈斗胆，想请教文章。",
              "nextNodeId": "essay-talk",
              "conditions": [
                { "kind": "npcRelationship", "npcId": "char.liu-tinglan", "maxValue": 4 }
              ],
              "effects": [{ "kind": "adjustRelationship", "delta": 5 }]
            },
            {
              "text": "我愿拜入寒山书院。",
              "nextNodeId": "accepted",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "factionMembership", "isMember": false }],
              "effects": [
                { "kind": "joinFaction", "factionId": "faction.hanshan-shuyuan" },
                { "kind": "adjustFactionRenown", "factionId": "faction.hanshan-shuyuan", "delta": 10 }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "门中课业可有新吩咐？",
              "nextNodeId": "tasked",
              "conditions": [
                { "kind": "factionMembership", "factionId": "faction.hanshan-shuyuan", "isMember": true },
                { "kind": "factionRenown", "factionId": "faction.hanshan-shuyuan", "minValue": 10 }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "我想请先生指点书院武学。",
              "nextNodeId": "r32-lessons",
              "conditions": [
                { "kind": "factionMembership", "factionId": "faction.hanshan-shuyuan", "isMember": true }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "我想退出寒山书院。",
              "nextNodeId": "departed",
              "conditions": [
                { "kind": "factionMembership", "factionId": "faction.hanshan-shuyuan", "isMember": true }
              ],
              "effects": [{ "kind": "leaveFaction" }]
            },
            { "text": "不叨扰了，先生请便。", "nextNodeId": "farewell" },
            {
              "text": "白鹭洲托我来对一对旧渡籍。",
              "nextNodeId": "r42-copy-mismatch",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "questStatus", "questId": "quest.r42-ledger-audit", "status": "completed" }],
              "effects": [{ "kind": "discoverKnowledgeNode", "nodeId": "event.r42-faded-register" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "柳教习，请将两家口述分别记下。",
              "nextNodeId": "r42-witnesses-accepted",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "questStatus", "questId": "quest.r42-two-witnesses", "status": "offered" }],
              "effects": [{ "kind": "acceptQuest", "questId": "quest.r42-two-witnesses" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "公簿已经立下，往后任人对页。",
              "nextNodeId": "r42-public-result",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "questStatus", "questId": "quest.r42-open-register", "status": "completed" }],
              "effects": [{ "kind": "discoverKnowledgeNode", "nodeId": "event.r42-public-record-vow" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "papers",
          "text": "他把誊到一半的纸页晾在镇石下：「雾渡药道的轮值盟书。渡口公所立约，书院受托誊抄存档——江湖上的约，白纸黑字才立得住。你若要查章程，去渡口寻渡董白鹭洲，他掌着正本。」",
          "options": [
            { "text": "原来书院管着这些文书。", "nextNodeId": "scribe-duty" },
            { "text": "多谢先生，我去渡口看看。", "nextNodeId": "farewell" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "scribe-duty",
          "text": "「盟书、武录、地契、讼状，各派不愿自己记的账，都推给读书人记。」柳听澜把笔搁回笔山，「所以书院的弟子，笔要稳，眼要公。手上的功夫，倒是其次。」"
        },
        {
          "id": "essay-talk",
          "text": "「请教文章，先请教做人。」柳听澜取过一册抄本推到你面前，「字是人的骨。你抄一页看看——笔锋急躁的，心先急了；心急的人，读再多的书也只是认字。」"
        },
        {
          "id": "accepted",
          "text": "柳听澜搁笔起身，替你正了正衣冠：「入书院不为求一块招牌。从今日起，晨间抄书，午后习礼，武课在申时——先学把话说清楚，再学把笔拿稳，最后才轮到判官笔。」"
        },
        {
          "id": "tasked",
          "text": "「课业倒有一桩。」他从案头取出一叠空纸，「去渡口把轮值盟约的执行情况记回来——哪派守约、哪派误时，只记事实，不添褒贬。书院的笔，不偏不倚才有分量。」"
        },
        {
          "id": "r32-lessons",
          "text": "柳听澜翻开武录副本：「笔、步、气各有章法。读懂招式为何如此，再决定是否要学。」",
          "options": [
            { "text": "请教朱墨点腕笔。", "nextNodeId": "r32-taught", "conditions": [{ "kind": "martialArtEligible", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-hanshan-zhumo-bi" }], "effects": [{ "kind": "learnMartialArt", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-hanshan-zhumo-bi" }] },
            { "text": "请教点津校脉笔。", "nextNodeId": "r32-taught", "conditions": [{ "kind": "martialArtEligible", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-hanshan-dianjin-bi" }], "effects": [{ "kind": "learnMartialArt", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-hanshan-dianjin-bi" }] },
            { "text": "请教锋折批隙手。", "nextNodeId": "r32-taught", "conditions": [{ "kind": "martialArtEligible", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-hanshan-fengzhe-bi" }], "effects": [{ "kind": "learnMartialArt", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-hanshan-fengzhe-bi" }] },
            { "text": "请教经纶定息篇。", "nextNodeId": "r32-taught", "conditions": [{ "kind": "martialArtEligible", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-hanshan-jinglun-xinfa" }], "effects": [{ "kind": "learnMartialArt", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-hanshan-jinglun-xinfa" }] },
            { "text": "请教定理贯脉诀。", "nextNodeId": "r32-taught", "conditions": [{ "kind": "martialArtEligible", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-hanshan-dingli-jue" }], "effects": [{ "kind": "learnMartialArt", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-hanshan-dingli-jue" }] },
            { "text": "今日先到这里。", "nextNodeId": "farewell" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "r32-taught",
          "text": "柳听澜按你所选的招式逐式讲解，把每一步写在空白页边：「学武也要讲理路，明白为何出手，才知道何时收手。」",
          "options": [
            { "text": "再请教一门。", "nextNodeId": "r32-lessons" },
            { "text": "多谢先生，告辞。", "nextNodeId": "farewell" }
          ]
        },
        { "id": "departed", "text": "柳听澜沉默片刻，把你的名字从课业簿上圈去：「学籍除名，笔墨两清。书院的门不锁，但誊过的盟书里，不会再有你的手笔。」" },
        { "id": "farewell", "text": "「去吧。」柳听澜重新蘸墨，「路上少说多看——见过的事，都是文章。」" },
        {
          "id": "r42-copy-mismatch",
          "text": "柳听澜将两张纸举向窗前：「水痕在副本誊出之前已经干了，边角却压着新印。书院只照原页落笔，没有改这一行；要查谁搬动过正本，还须问熟悉水路与船印的人。」",
          "options": [{ "text": "我去问顾夜尘与祝九弦。", "nextNodeId": "farewell" }]
        },
        {
          "id": "r42-witnesses-accepted",
          "text": "「两家都问，不替任何一方润色。」柳听澜抽出一张空白对页纸，「顾夜尘熟潮时，祝九弦认旧印。把原话各记一行，字句有出入才看得出疑处。」"
        },
        {
          "id": "r42-public-result",
          "text": "柳听澜把副册摊开，指着新添的一行：「证词、拓本、疑问都在。日后若有人能证实另一种说法，也有空白处可添；立册是让事情可复查，不是把今天的判断钉死。」"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg.zhu-jiuxian-mentor",
      "startNodeId": "greet",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "greet",
          "text": "祝九弦蹲在栈桥头清点缆绳，指节粗大，动作却极利落。见你停步，他头也不抬：「借过便借过，站着不动，是要问刀，还是要问船？」",
          "options": [
            {
              "text": "我愿拜入盘舷刀场。",
              "nextNodeId": "accepted",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "factionMembership", "isMember": false }],
              "effects": [
                { "kind": "joinFaction", "factionId": "faction.panzhou-daochang" },
                { "kind": "adjustFactionRenown", "factionId": "faction.panzhou-daochang", "delta": 10 }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "请师父指点护船与刀场功夫。",
              "nextNodeId": "r32-lessons",
              "conditions": [
                { "kind": "factionMembership", "factionId": "faction.panzhou-daochang", "isMember": true }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "我想退出盘舷刀场。",
              "nextNodeId": "departed",
              "conditions": [
                { "kind": "factionMembership", "factionId": "faction.panzhou-daochang", "isMember": true }
              ],
              "effects": [{ "kind": "leaveFaction" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "雾渡药道会盟争得先约，特来告知。",
              "nextNodeId": "war-victory",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "knowledgeKnown", "nodeId": "event.mist-pact-victory" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "药道按轮值成约了，来报个信。",
              "nextNodeId": "war-stalemate",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "knowledgeKnown", "nodeId": "event.mist-pact-stalemate" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "会盟没争下先约，跟您说一声。",
              "nextNodeId": "war-defeat",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "knowledgeKnown", "nodeId": "event.mist-pact-defeat" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "渡口的轮值章程，去哪里查？",
              "nextNodeId": "registry-point"
            },
            { "text": "随便看看，这就走。", "nextNodeId": "farewell" },
            {
              "text": "祝师父，旧船印旁那道潮泥，是何时留下的？",
              "nextNodeId": "r42-zhu-seal-account",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "questStatus", "questId": "quest.r42-two-witnesses", "status": "active" }],
              "effects": [{ "kind": "discoverKnowledgeNode", "nodeId": "event.r42-zhu-ferry-seal" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "祝师父，我把你认出的旧印记入副页。",
              "nextNodeId": "r42-zhu-seal-account",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "questStatus", "questId": "quest.r42-two-witnesses", "status": "completed" }],
              "effects": [{ "kind": "discoverKnowledgeNode", "nodeId": "event.r42-zhu-ferry-seal" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "我把证词和拓本交给你封存。",
              "nextNodeId": "r42-protect-result",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "questStatus", "questId": "quest.r42-protect-witness", "status": "completed" }],
              "effects": [{ "kind": "discoverKnowledgeNode", "nodeId": "event.r42-protected-witness-vow" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "accepted",
          "text": "祝九弦把一截缆绳抛过来，看你接住了才咧嘴一笑：「接得稳，就有得教。刀场的规矩记牢——上船先认缆桩，出刀先认人。哪条船要护、哪步不能退，比刀法先学。」"
        },
        {
          "id": "r32-lessons",
          "text": "祝九弦把几页刀谱压在缆绳下：「先学护船的规矩，再挑合你手脚的一式。窄板上站稳，比一刀劈得响更要紧。」",
          "options": [
            { "text": "请教拦门刀法。", "nextNodeId": "r32-taught", "conditions": [{ "kind": "martialArtEligible", "martialArtId": "skill.lanmen-daofa" }], "effects": [{ "kind": "learnMartialArt", "martialArtId": "skill.lanmen-daofa" }] },
            { "text": "请教翻桨刀。", "nextNodeId": "r32-taught", "conditions": [{ "kind": "martialArtEligible", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-panzhou-fanjing-dao" }], "effects": [{ "kind": "learnMartialArt", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-panzhou-fanjing-dao" }] },
            { "text": "请教截浪回舷刀。", "nextNodeId": "r32-taught", "conditions": [{ "kind": "martialArtEligible", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-panzhou-jielan-dao" }], "effects": [{ "kind": "learnMartialArt", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-panzhou-jielan-dao" }] },
            { "text": "请教顺汛换步。", "nextNodeId": "r32-taught", "conditions": [{ "kind": "martialArtEligible", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-panzhou-shunxun-bu" }], "effects": [{ "kind": "learnMartialArt", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-panzhou-shunxun-bu" }] },
            { "text": "请教破白连环刀。", "nextNodeId": "r32-taught", "conditions": [{ "kind": "martialArtEligible", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-panzhou-pobai-dao" }], "effects": [{ "kind": "learnMartialArt", "martialArtId": "skill.r32-panzhou-pobai-dao" }] },
            { "text": "今日先到这里。", "nextNodeId": "farewell" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "r32-taught",
          "text": "祝九弦按你所选的路数带你在窄板上走过一轮：「刀可以收，脚不能乱。护住同船的人，才算真会使刀。」",
          "options": [
            { "text": "再请教一门。", "nextNodeId": "r32-lessons" },
            { "text": "多谢师父，告辞。", "nextNodeId": "farewell" }
          ]
        },
        { "id": "departed", "text": "祝九弦把缆绳收拢，半天说了一句：「船开了就不追。刀场的名号你带走，刀场的规矩留下——往后护人护己，自己掂量。」" },
        { "id": "war-victory", "text": "「先约争到手，船期便定得早。」祝九弦点点头，「不过赢得时辰不算赢——替我把那句『对方药队照旧过桥』也记全了，护船的只认章程，不认输赢。」" },
        { "id": "war-stalemate", "text": "「轮值？」他把缆绳结了个死扣，「这是最省事的结局。两派药队各走各的时辰，我们护航的排班也最稳。都赢一点，就都少赔一点。」" },
        { "id": "war-defeat", "text": "「先约让了就让了。」祝九弦不以为意，「药道又没封，轮值照旧，船照开。下回会盟前把船上功夫练扎实，比在这儿懊恼强。」" },
        { "id": "registry-point", "text": "「轮值章程？」祝九弦朝渡口公所的方向一抬下巴，「找渡董白鹭洲，渡籍正本在他手上。哪派哪个时辰过桥、误时怎么罚，白纸黑字，比十个教头记性都牢。」" },
        { "id": "farewell", "text": "「栈桥湿滑，走稳些。」祝九弦重新蹲下去盘他的缆绳，不再看你。" },
        {
          "id": "r42-zhu-seal-account",
          "text": "祝九弦捻了捻指间旧茧：「那枚印压在缆桩内侧，船退潮后才看得见。泥还湿的时候，我先记了印，没有记人——过了这么些年，我只敢说它不是副本誊出来的。」",
          "options": [{ "text": "我会把印与口述一并记下。", "nextNodeId": "farewell" }]
        },
        {
          "id": "r42-protect-result",
          "text": "祝九弦把拓本放进干燥的木匣，另留一张无名收据：「东西在这儿，来人却不记名。等当事人愿意开口，再把两边的页合起来；纸没丢，话也没被逼出来。」"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg.bai-luzhou-ferry-master",
      "startNodeId": "greet",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "greet",
          "text": "渡口公所的檐下，白鹭洲正把一册翻旧的船票簿合上。他把算盘拨了一颗，抬眼道：「渡籍在此。要过桥的问班次，要讲理的查章程——你是哪一种？」",
          "options": [
            {
              "text": "想请教渡口的通行章程。",
              "nextNodeId": "registry-talk",
              "effects": [{ "kind": "discoverKnowledgeNode", "nodeId": "event.ferry-passage-registry" }]
            },
            { "text": "渡口如今有哪些门派走动？", "nextNodeId": "factions-talk" },
            {
              "text": "我已列入门墙，渡籍上可要登记？",
              "nextNodeId": "registry-joined",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "factionMembership", "isMember": true }]
            },
            {
              "text": "雾渡药道会盟争得先约，报与渡籍。",
              "nextNodeId": "logged-victory",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "knowledgeKnown", "nodeId": "event.mist-pact-victory" }],
              "effects": [
                { "kind": "shareKnowledgeNode", "nodeId": "event.mist-pact-victory" },
                { "kind": "adjustRelationship", "npcId": "char.bai-luzhou", "delta": 5 }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "药道按轮值成了约，我来报备。",
              "nextNodeId": "logged-stalemate",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "knowledgeKnown", "nodeId": "event.mist-pact-stalemate" }],
              "effects": [
                { "kind": "shareKnowledgeNode", "nodeId": "event.mist-pact-stalemate" },
                { "kind": "adjustRelationship", "npcId": "char.bai-luzhou", "delta": 5 }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "会盟没争到先约，也该记上一笔。",
              "nextNodeId": "logged-defeat",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "knowledgeKnown", "nodeId": "event.mist-pact-defeat" }],
              "effects": [
                { "kind": "shareKnowledgeNode", "nodeId": "event.mist-pact-defeat" },
                { "kind": "adjustRelationship", "npcId": "char.bai-luzhou", "delta": 5 }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "渡籍里记下的轮值之约，执行得如何？",
              "nextNodeId": "remembered-pact",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "npcKnows", "nodeId": "event.mist-pact-stalemate" }]
            },
            { "text": "都不是，随便看看。", "nextNodeId": "farewell" },
            {
              "text": "补录过的旧簿，柳教习发现了不合潮时的水痕。",
              "nextNodeId": "r42-audit-offer",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "questStatus", "questId": "quest.r42-ledger-audit", "status": "offered" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "拓本已存，我愿把证据公开立册。",
              "nextNodeId": "r42-public-vow",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "questStatus", "questId": "quest.r42-open-register", "status": "offered" }],
              "effects": [{ "kind": "acceptQuest", "questId": "quest.r42-open-register" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "拓本已存，我想先护住作证之人。",
              "nextNodeId": "r42-protect-vow",
              "conditions": [{ "kind": "questStatus", "questId": "quest.r42-protect-witness", "status": "offered" }],
              "effects": [{ "kind": "acceptQuest", "questId": "quest.r42-protect-witness" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "registry-talk",
          "text": "「章程三条。」白鹭洲竖起手指，「一，药队过桥按时辰轮值，先约者先行，后约者不得抢渡；二，误时半刻，下轮让位；三，争执不下的，渡籍为凭，两家各执一份。」他把簿子翻开一页，「寒山书院誊的抄本，连墨迹深浅都校过三遍——江湖上的约，得有人肯这么记。」",
          "options": [
            { "text": "记得这样细，渡口从不误事么？", "nextNodeId": "registry-strict" },
            { "text": "受教了，告辞。", "nextNodeId": "farewell" }
